(7286180, 1135520, 25024, '<td valign="top">Whilst I do like these sort of images, I think it is a little too abstract and because I can''t work out what I''m looking at I can''t also determine what, if any, forced perspective there is. Good luck</td>', 'Whilst I do like these sort of images, I think it is a little too abstract and because I can''t work out what I''m looking at I can''t also determine what, if any, forced perspective there is. Good luck', '2014-11-19 10:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7286181, 1135542, 25024, '<td valign="top">I assume the connection we are to make is the slope of the slide against the slope of the mountains? As they are going in different directions this is not working and this slide is so dominant it overpowers any illusion you may be trying to create. Sorry, I wish you well with it.</td>', 'I assume the connection we are to make is the slope of the slide against the slope of the mountains? As they are going in different directions this is not working and this slide is so dominant it overpowers any illusion you may be trying to create. Sorry, I wish you well with it.', '2014-11-19 10:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7286182, 1135560, 25024, '<td valign="top">A black halo, wicked Sofia! I''m sure you will get plenty of comments about the image softness and low contrast but in view of what you are trying to convey perhaps a tighter crop may have worked better? Good luck</td>', 'A black halo, wicked Sofia! I''m sure you will get plenty of comments about the image softness and low contrast but in view of what you are trying to convey perhaps a tighter crop may have worked better? Good luck', '2014-11-19 10:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
