(7287104, 1135487, 37858, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing that you made this image without anyone''s help.  I say that because the hand is blurred a bit and at an angle that suggests that to me.  If you had another person''s hand I think you might have had a sharper result.  Still, I like the effort.</td>', 'I''m guessing that you made this image without anyone''s help.  I say that because the hand is blurred a bit and at an angle that suggests that to me.  If you had another person''s hand I think you might have had a sharper result.  Still, I like the effort.', '2014-11-22 19:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7287105, 1135547, 37858, '<td valign="top">Nice connection between the cup and your hand.  The cat in the negative space is a bonus.  I''d prefer a bit less noise, but that''s just a personal preference.  Well done IMHO.</td>', 'Nice connection between the cup and your hand.  The cat in the negative space is a bonus.  I''d prefer a bit less noise, but that''s just a personal preference.  Well done IMHO.', '2014-11-22 19:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7287107, 1135513, 37858, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but it looks like their feet are just above the tops of the can rather than on them (judging by body language I''m guessing the younger child was not too excited to be helping with this project).  I also think that the camera bag and tripod do not add to the image unless they are hiding something unsightly behind them.  I just think it might be a bit cleaner without the extra props.  Still, I like the effort and scored it relatively high.</td>', 'I like the idea, but it looks like their feet are just above the tops of the can rather than on them (judging by body language I''m guessing the younger child was not too excited to be helping with this project).  I also think that the camera bag and tripod do not add to the image unless they are hiding something unsightly behind them.  I just think it might be a bit cleaner without the extra props.  Still, I like the effort and scored it relatively high.', '2014-11-22 19:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7287108, 1135532, 37858, '<td valign="top">One of my choices to ribbon.  Nice connection between the crane and the tower.  Well done.</td>', 'One of my choices to ribbon.  Nice connection between the crane and the tower.  Well done.', '2014-11-22 19:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
